Z||000002||Monkeyman||07-12-2001||06:07 PM||||When Jim says shipping included, that's exactly what he means.  You won't have to pay a cent extra for anything.  As a matter of fact, he sent me another part to mine (long story, but nothing was broken) and didn't even charge me for that.  All you'll have to pay for is the materials to cover the box, some contact cement and some staples.  Hell of a good deal, if you don't mind me saying so.  And, no.  I'm not getting paid to say any of this.  I bought both of his audio products and love them both.  ||||reg||1
