Z||000005||Huck||07-12-2001||09:01 PM||||Yeah, I had some fee's... of course!!  I had to give the post office $56.32 before they would give me my parcel.<P>Duty: 6%       14.06<BR>GST:  7%       17.39<BR>PST:  8%       19.87<BR>Handleing Fee:  5.00<BR>               ------<BR>              $56.32<P>Grand total of the enclosure in Canadian dollars:  $290.65<P>Gotta love Taxes... and the customs was based on 234.33 (150 american) at 6%..<P>Huck||||reg||1
